# Design research captures — reference material, not source.
#
# The design process screenshots references and its own builds (~180MB of PNGs).
# They are worth keeping locally while a design is in flight, and worth nothing
# in git history forever. What IS committed: the spec, the teardowns that record
# what each reference taught us, and the mockup HTML the build was made from.
#
# If you need the captures, they can be re-gathered — every teardown names its
# source URL.
shots/
inspiration/
mockups/shots/
